# Preset for 4 MB boards: two ~1.9 MB app slots for over-the-air updates (POST /api/ota, IDE Board panel), with rollback:
# a new image that doesn't come up runs the old one again. NVS stays at the same offset, so saved settings survive.
# Switching a board to this layout (or back) needs one USB flash: the IDE's "Flash over USB" or idf.py flash.
# Use with: idf.py -D SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.flash4mb" ...
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE_4MB=y
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM=y
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM_FILENAME="partitions_4mb.csv"
CONFIG_BOOTLOADER_APP_ROLLBACK_ENABLE=y
CONFIG_KTSN_OTA=y
